Package: ekbMed
Title: Reproducible Clinical Survival Analysis and Reporting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marc", "Bender", email = "mbender1992@web.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a unified workflow for clinical survival analysis,
    propensity-score weighting, multiple imputation, subgroup treatment
    effects, and publication-ready tables and forest plots. Separates
    imputation from outcome modelling and estimates weights within each
    completed imputation. Includes explicit clinical conversion rules and
    non-mutating data quality checks.
